# Next.js Admin

## Auth

- Access token in React memory (not localStorage)
- Refresh via httpOnly cookie + `credentials: 'include'`
- Attach `Authorization: Bearer` on admin API calls

## Data

- `@tanstack/react-query` for all server state
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` + `lib/api.ts` wrapper
- DTOs from `@qpulse/shared`

## Forms

- react-hook-form + zod
- Signal form: validate `closeDate` when CLOSED, `liquidated` only when CLOSED

## Pages

/login, /dashboard, /signals, /results-summary, /menu-links, /reviews, /home-content, /settings, /notifications

## UI

Dark Tailwind, desktop-first. Simple tables/forms OK without shadcn.

## After API changes

Update page if new admin endpoint added. Sync `docs/contracts/rest-api.md`.
